Spectrum Hub: voice-driven music hub for TrueNAS

Server side for Spectrum Player. Takes voice commands from the phone over a
WebSocket, parses them (rules or a local llama.cpp model with JSON-schema
output), plays songs from Jellyfin or fetches them from Soulseek via slskd,
tags and files them, waits for Jellyfin to index them, then tells the phone
to play or queue them.

- FastAPI app with web dashboard (status, requests, Soulseek activity,
  downloads, CPU/RAM/GPU/VRAM, LLM speed and live output, model manager)
- MCP server at /mcp (Bearer token)
- Docker image with llama-server built on CUDA 12.4 (Pascal support)
- TrueNAS install YAML (hub + slskd) and GitHub Actions build to GHCR
- Mock Jellyfin/slskd for local testing

